                                "sense_id": "039b2093-3222-31b0-aba0-8febaff59f00",
                                "text": "Have low-calorie snacks such as raw vegetables, hot air-cooked popcorn, diet gelatin, apples, grapefruit, and sugar-free products on hand at all times and avoid having high-calorie foods readily available. […] When you \"miseat\" for one or more days, do not feel overly guilty about these episodes."
